// canonicalCorrector, and what only it reaches
//
// The picker DoCorrection clones for a word double-tapped in a view whose
// viewCorrectionPopupScript may change it (system/builtinFunctions.ns): a
// protoCorrector with the bounds, the alternative words (pickItems), the
// refCon (the view and word) and the word's correction info.

canonicalCorrector := {_proto: @protoCorrector, bounds: nil, pickItems: nil, refCon: nil, wordInfo: nil};
